      "width": 1640,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "#143A8F",
      "text": "## 基础设施与发布治理\n\n配置 · 制品 · Release Manifest"
    },
    {
      "id": "cp-observability",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 210,
      "y": 1930,
      "width": 1640,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "#143A8F",
      "text": "## 可观测性\n\nLog · Metric · Trace  \n必须有真实采集出口"
    },
    {
      "id": "mall-experience",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2290,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 4820,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "#1F5EFF",
      "text": "## 体验层\n\n**顾客** → Storefront / Miniapp　　**运营人员** → Console　　**Owner / 管理员** → Auth / Account  \nZHU-VI Design System → Token · Component · Pattern"
    },
    {
      "id": "mall-contract",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2290,
      "y": 1070,
      "width": 4820,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "#1F5EFF",
      "text": "## 唯一合同层\n\nOperations · Capabilities · Errors · Events · Generated SDK  \n一个操作一个权威定义 · 一个能力一个判定入口 · 前端只通过 Generated SDK"
    },
    {
      "id": "mall-core",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2290,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 4820,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "#239B56",
      "text": "## Commerce 业务内核｜Mall Core\n\n**身份与组织**　IAM · Organization · Member  \n**商品与交易准备**　Catalog · Pricing · Inventory · Cart · Checkout  \n**交易事实**　OMS · Payment · Finance · Fulfillment  \n**增长与运营**　Channel · Referral · Benefit · Voucher · Support · Notification · Risk · Audit · Reporting"
    },
    {
      "id": "mall-runtime",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2290,
      "y": 1660,
      "width": 4820,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "#52667F",
      "text": "## 运行层\n\nCommerce API → Application Service → Domain  \nOutbox Dispatcher → Commerce Jobs → Provider / Vendor Adapters  \n外部供应商协议只能存在于 Adapter 一侧"
    },
    {
      "id": "mall-data",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2290,
      "y": 1910,
      "width": 4820,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#E8751A",
      "text": "## Canonical 数据层\n\nCanonical PostgreSQL · Cache · Object Storage · Migration Ledger  \n领域拥有自己的写入边界，共享物理数据库不等于共享数据所有权"
    },
    {
      "id": "mall-request-chain",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2290,
      "y": 2120,
      "width": 4820,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#143A8F",
      "text": "## 唯一请求链\n\nUI → Generated SDK → Commerce API → Application Service → Domain → Repository → Canonical PostgreSQL"
    },
    {
      "id": "replication-core",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7620,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 1700,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#E5482D",
      "text": "## 标准商城内核 Mall Core\n\n同一套代码与构建产物"
    },
    {
      "id": "replication-l0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7510,
      "y": 1070,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "#E5482D",
      "text": "## L0\n\n甄选商城  \n平台自营"
    },
    {
      "id": "replication-l1-l11",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8420,
      "y": 1070,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "#E5482D",
      "text": "## L1—L11\n\n完整独立商城  \n同一内核生成"
    },
    {
      "id": "replication-instance-truth",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7620,
      "y": 1310,
      "width": 1700,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "#E5482D",
      "text": "## 每个实例独立拥有\n\nmall_id · 业务数据 · 经营状态  \n配置 · 品牌 · 生命周期"
    },
    {
      "id": "replication-isolation",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7620,
      "y": 1610,
      "width": 1700,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "#E5482D",
      "text": "## 运行独立性\n\n不查询父商城或祖先链  \n层级服务不可用，仍可浏览、下单、支付、履约、退款与记账"
    },
    {
      "id": "replication-terms",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7620,
      "y": 1950,
      "width": 1700,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "#E5482D",
      "text": "## 名词边界\n\n**Mall Product**＝完整产品所有权边界  \n**Mall Scope**＝mall_id 身份与数据范围  \n**MallContext ≠ 商城系统 Mall**"
    },
    {
      "id": "system-base",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3000,
      "y": 2290,
      "width": 3600,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#07182F",
      "text": "# 战略运行基座　平台负责创建与治理 · Mall 负责完整交易 · 实例保持独立运行"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-head",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3450,
      "y": 2620,
      "width": 2700,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#52667F",
      "text": "# Mall Core 交易发动机｜四条线各自拥有状态与数据事实，不共享写入权"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-order",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 2780,
      "width": 9200,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#1F5EFF",
      "text": "## 订单流｜购买意图　→　购物车与结算　→　订单创建　→　订单状态　→　取消或完成　→　售后关系"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-product",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 2990,
      "width": 9200,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#239B56",
      "text": "## 商品流｜商品　→　SKU　→　价格　→　库存　→　预占或释放　→　履约　→　发货与收货　→　退货"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-cash",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 3200,
      "width": 9200,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#E8751A",
      "text": "## 现金流｜支付请求　→　支付渠道　→　回调与确认　→　实收　→　退款　→　资金移动状态　→　支付结果"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-finance",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 3410,
      "width": 9200,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#7A4BC0",
      "text": "## 财务流｜应收应付　→　内部账本　→　凭证　→　分配　→　结算　→　对账　→　差异处理"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-links",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 3620,
      "width": 4200,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "#52667F",
      "text": "## 关键跨线关联\n\n结算读取商品与库存事实 · 订单触发库存预占与支付请求  \n支付成功回写订单状态并形成财务事实 · 售后触发退货、退款与逆向记账"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-complete",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4600,
      "y": 3620,
      "width": 2000,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "#143A8F",
      "text": "## 四线汇合｜完整交易事实\n\n订单事实 + 商品与库存事实  \n+ 现金事实 + 财务事实"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-rule",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6800,
      "y": 3620,
      "width": 2400,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "#52667F",
      "text": "## 跨线规则\n\n只通过命令、查询或领域事件协作  \n可识别 · 可追踪 · 可重试 · 幂等 · 可补偿 · 历史快照不可改写"
    },
    {
      "id": "boundary-hierarchy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 4260,
      "width": 950,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "#8493A8",
      "text": "## Hierarchy & Provisioning\n\n生成 · 继承 · 关系 · 解绑  \n不进入单商城运行依赖"
    },
    {
      "id": "boundary-referral",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1160,
      "y": 4260,
      "width": 950,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "#8493A8",
      "text": "## Referral & Settlement\n\n消费稳定业务事实后计算与结算  \n失败不得阻塞订单完成"
    },
    {
      "id": "boundary-membership",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2170,
      "y": 4260,
      "width": 950,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "#8493A8",
